{"unit":8,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 8","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 8 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Language and learning</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx259\">Thirty questions on Unit 8 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u8\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u8r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I &hellip; swim when I was five.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">could</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">be able to</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She has never &hellip; to remember names.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">been able</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">could</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">can</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">By the end of the course they &hellip; read simple articles.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">will be able to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He &hellip; speak three languages.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">can</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">can to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r103\">Complete with one word or phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">In Finland teachers <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"must|have to\" data-why=\"Necessary: <b>must</b> / <b>have to</b> have a master&rsquo;s degree.\"> have a master&rsquo;s degree.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">State schools are free, so you <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"do not have to|don&rsquo;t have to|don't have to|dont have to\" data-why=\"Not necessary: <b>don&rsquo;t have to</b> pay.\"> pay.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">You <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"cannot|can&rsquo;t|can't|mustn't|must not|mustn&rsquo;t|cant\" data-why=\"Forbidden: <b>can&rsquo;t</b> / <b>mustn&rsquo;t</b> use your phone.\"> use your phone during the exam.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r104\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">Students &hellip; wear a uniform, but most of them do.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">don&rsquo;t have to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">mustn&rsquo;t</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">should</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">You &hellip; smoke in the laboratory. It is dangerous.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">don&rsquo;t have to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">mustn&rsquo;t</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">should</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; I need to write in block capitals?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"After <b>can</b> the verb is plain: <i>I can play the guitar</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">can</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">play</span> <span class=\"ew\">the</span> <span class=\"ew\">guitar</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"2\" data-why=\"The negative of <i>have to</i> is <b>don&rsquo;t have to</b>: <i>You don&rsquo;t have to come tomorrow</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">You</span> <span class=\"ew\">haven&rsquo;t</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">come</span> <span class=\"ew\">tomorrow</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">I wasn&rsquo;t able to solve it.<br>I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"could not solve it|couldn&rsquo;t solve it|couldn't solve it|couldnt solve it\" data-why=\"Past ability, negative: <b>couldn&rsquo;t solve it</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">It isn&rsquo;t necessary to book a place.<br>You <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"don't have to book a place|do not have to book a place|don&rsquo;t have to book a place|do not have to book|don&rsquo;t have to book|don't have to book\" data-why=\"Not necessary: <b>don&rsquo;t have to book</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u8r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">You have to pass an entrance <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"exam\" data-why=\"An <b>entrance exam</b> is a test you pass before a school accepts you.\"> to get into that school.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">She has a master&rsquo;s <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"degree\" data-why=\"A <b>degree</b> is the qualification you get when you finish a university course.\"> in economics.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">A teacher who expects everyone to obey the rules exactly is <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"strict\" data-why=\"<b>Strict</b> = expecting people to obey the rules exactly.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Write your name in block <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"capitals\" data-why=\"<b>Block capitals</b> = large letters, used so writing is easy to read.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Please <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"tick\" data-why=\"<b>Tick</b> = put a small mark in a box to show your choice.\"> the box if you agree.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">He is very good at map &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">reading</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">read</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to read</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">The relative we contact in an emergency is your next of &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">kin</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">family</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">relative</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">I looked it up on a &hellip; engine.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">search</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">looking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">finding</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are school subjects. A <b>diploma</b> is a document.\"><span class=\"ew\">maths</span> <span class=\"ew\">science</span> <span class=\"ew\">literature</span> <span class=\"ew\">diploma</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others go on a form. A <b>promotion</b> happens at work.\"><span class=\"ew\">surname</span> <span class=\"ew\">occupation</span> <span class=\"ew\">signature</span> <span class=\"ew\">promotion</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u8r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">Sorry, what do you &hellip; by &lsquo;next of kin&rsquo;?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">mean</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">say</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tell</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; you say that again, please?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Could</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Should</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Do</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">The line is very bad. You&rsquo;re &hellip; up.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">breaking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">broken</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">break</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\"><input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"Do|do\" data-why=\"<b>Do I need to&hellip;?</b> &mdash; checking what is required on a form.\"> I need to fill in this part?</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">Please write your name here and add your <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"signature\" data-why=\"Your <b>signature</b> is your name written by you, to show the document is yours.\"> below.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u8r114\">Put the three lines of the exchange in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">It means: are you married or single?</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Ah, I see. Thank you.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Sorry, what do you mean by &lsquo;marital status&rsquo;?</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}